AIOpen:
There are three main skills that might be still difficult to reach for LLM:
- Specifying properly a software (and nice APIs);
- Debugging code properly;
- Finding (and fixing) security issues in code.

Experience in designing and debugging complex systems (including those requiring math knowledge);
Knowledge in how to deal with legacy code that may be not a part of typical learning datasets of AIs;
Ability to explain things to people, individually adapting them for better understanding;
Ability to apply experience gained in one area to other fields.

trying to be efficient
having a broad knowledge of the software development process
using tools to organize work (jira)
